ORIGINAL GAME
Castle Adventure (1984) was written and designed by Kevin Bales. He wrote the
original room descriptions and game text, and designed the puzzles, the map
layout, the item and monster placements and the game itself. The name "Castle
Adventure" is his. All of that is his work and remains his. It is NOT covered
by this project's code license (LICENSE) or art license (LICENSE-ART), and no
one here grants any rights to it.

This remake is not affiliated with, authorized or endorsed by Kevin Bales. It
is free and non-commercial. It will be taken down on request from the rights
holder.

DATA SOURCE: SEED7
The room data comes from Thomas Mertes' Seed7 rewrite of Castle Adventure
(castle.sd7 and castle.dat, https://github.com/ThomasMertes/seed7, prg/).
src/castle.sd7 and src/castle.dat are included unmodified with their original
notice, which is preserved here:

